msgid "- Check share permissions (read/write)\n"
msgstr "- Periksa izin berbagi (baca/tulis)\n"

msgid "- Ensure NAS is powered on and accessible\n"
msgstr "- Pastikan NAS dihidupkan dan dapat diakses\n"

msgid "- Enter server IP, share name, username and password\n"
msgstr "- Masukkan IP server, nama berbagi, nama pengguna dan kata sandi\n"

msgid "- Go to Main Menu > Setup > System > Storage Manager\n"
msgstr "- Buka Menu Utama > Pengaturan > Sistem > Manajer Penyimpanan\n"

msgid "- HDD backups: Stored in /media/hdd/backup\n"
msgstr "- Cadangan HDD: Disimpan di /media/hdd/backup\n"

msgid "- Keep regular backups of your system\n"
msgstr "- Simpan cadangan rutin sistem Anda\n"

msgid "- NET backups: Require mounted CIFS/NFS share with write permissions\n"
msgstr "- Pencadangan NET: Memerlukan berbagi CIFS/NFS yang dipasang dengan izin menulis\n"

msgid "- Never interrupt backup/restore processes\n"
msgstr "- Jangan pernah mengganggu proses pencadangan/pemulihan\n"

msgid "- Restore: Works from HDD, USB, NET or MMC storage\n"
msgstr "- Pemulihan: Berfungsi dari penyimpanan HDD, USB, NET, atau MMC\n"

msgid "- Select 'Network Storage' and add your NAS/SMB share\n"
msgstr "- Pilih 'Penyimpanan Jaringan' dan tambahkan share NAS/SMB Anda\n"

msgid "- Test connection with ping command\n"
msgstr "- Uji koneksi dengan perintah ping\n"

msgid "- USB backups: Require FAT32-formatted drive with 'backupstick' file\n"
msgstr "- Pencadangan USB: Memerlukan drive berformat FAT32 dengan file 'backupstick'\n"

msgid "- Use quality USB drives for recovery sticks\n"
msgstr "- Gunakan drive USB berkualitas untuk stik pemulihan\n"

msgid "- Verify username/password are correct\n"
msgstr "- Verifikasi nama pengguna/kata sandi sudah benar\n"

msgid "- Verify you have enough free storage space\n"
msgstr "- Pastikan Anda memiliki cukup ruang penyimpanan kosong\n"

msgid "1. Mount your network share first:\n"
msgstr "1. Pasang jaringan berbagi Anda terlebih dahulu:\n"

msgid "2. Select 'NET Backup' from the device list\n"
msgstr "2. Pilih 'NET Backup' dari daftar perangkat\n"

msgid "3. Choose your mounted network share\n"
msgstr "3. Pilih berbagi jaringan terpasang Anda\n"

msgid "A recording is currently running. Please stop the recording before trying to start a flashing."
msgstr "Rekaman sedang berjalan. Harap hentikan perekaman sebelum mencoba memulai flashing."

